+    positions which cannot be identified (no position of the level, a
+    projection under a value consumed by a loan projector), or if the kept
+    projection is not the single view of the selected positions (see
+    [SymbolicToPureTypes.back_adt_view_keys]) of an ADT: the type of the
+    selection is then one value of the ADT, which the kept projection gives. *)
